# Generated HTML dumps of the maintained Markdown beside them. A tool wrote
# them from DESIGN_NOTES.md and POC_SUMMARY.md; the .md are the source and
# stay tracked.
DESIGN_NOTES.html
POC_SUMMARY.html

# Dated backup copies of the maintained RETROSPECTIVE.md, which stays tracked.
RETROSPECTIVE_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].md

# The registered cc-traces acceptance workloads. These are a slice of a
# licensed 568 MB corpus, reproduced by `cc_traces_workload.py emit` from the
# manifest beside them; the manifest, the protocol and the lock stay tracked
# and are what registers them. See `registered_workload` in
# scripts/compass/cc_traces_validate.py for the refusal when one is absent.
cc_traces_*.jsonl
